<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>幕末維新MAP - 志士たちの足跡を辿る</title>
<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/maplibre-gl@4.7.1/dist/maplibre-gl.css" rel="stylesheet" />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@400;500;700&family=Noto+Serif+JP:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style is:global>
:root{
  --indigo:#1c2d47; --indigo-deep:#0e1626; --indigo-light:#33496b;
  --washi:#f3ead8; --washi-deep:#e9dcbf; --line:#d9c79e;
  --sumi:#221f1a; --shu:#a5372a; --gold:#96793f;
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
body{font-family:'Noto Sans JP',sans-serif;color:var(--sumi);background:var(--washi);line-height:1.75;}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:'Noto Serif JP',serif;}
img{max-width:100%;display:block;}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}
.container{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;}
.seal{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--shu);color:var(--shu);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Noto Serif JP',serif;
  font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;flex-shrink:0;}
.header{background:var(--indigo);position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1000;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);}
.header-content{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:14px 0;}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;}
.logo .seal{border-color:#c98c3c;color:#e0c07f;font-size:.95rem;}
.logo-text h1{font-size:1.35rem;color:#f3ead8;font-weight:700;}
.logo-text p{font-size:.72rem;color:#a9b6c9;letter-spacing:.05em;}
.nav ul{display:flex;list-style:none;gap:2.2rem;}
.nav a{color:#d8dee8;font-size:.92rem;padding:.3rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid transparent;}
.nav a:hover{border-color:var(--gold);color:#f3ead8;}
.hero{position:relative;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--indigo) 0%,var(--indigo-deep) 100%);
  color:#f3ead8;padding:5.5rem 0 0;overflow:hidden;}
.hero-inner{position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:640px;padding-bottom:3rem;}
.hero-eyebrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.7rem;margin-bottom:1.4rem;color:#c98c3c;font-size:.85rem;letter-spacing:.08em;}
.hero-eyebrow .rule{width:36px;height:1px;background:#c98c3c;}
.hero h2{font-size:2.6rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:1.2rem;}
.hero p{font-size:1.02rem;color:#c3cbdb;max-width:34em;margin-bottom:2.2rem;}
.cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem;padding:.85rem 1.8rem;border:1.5px solid var(--gold);
  color:#f3ead8;font-weight:700;font-family:'Noto Serif JP',serif;font-size:.98rem;transition:.25s;}
.cta:hover{background:var(--gold);color:var(--indigo-deep);}
.hero-waves{position:absolute;bottom:-2px;left:0;width:100%;line-height:0;z-index:1;}
section{padding:4.5rem 0;}
.section-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:1.4rem;margin-bottom:2.2rem;}
.section-head .tab{writing-mode:vertical-rl;font-family:'Noto Serif JP',serif;font-size:.85rem;
  letter-spacing:.3em;color:var(--gold);padding-bottom:.3rem;}
.section-head h2{font-size:1.9rem;color:var(--indigo);font-weight:700;}
.section-head p{font-size:.85rem;color:#7a705a;margin-top:.3rem;}
.divider{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;max-width:220px;margin:0 auto 2.5rem;}
.divider::before,.divider::after{content:'';flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--line);}
.divider .seal{width:26px;height:26px;font-size:.72rem;}
.map-section{background:var(--washi);}
.timeline-panel{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fffef9;padding:1.4rem 1.6rem;margin-bottom:1.2rem;}
.tp-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1rem;}
.tp-year{font-family:'Noto Serif JP',serif;font-size:1.6rem;color:var(--shu);font-weight:700;}
.tp-title{font-family:'Noto Serif JP',serif;font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--indigo);font-weight:700;}
.tp-desc{font-size:.86rem;color:#4a463d;margin-top:.2rem;}
.tp-controls{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem;}
.tp-btn{width:38px;height:38px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;
  color:var(--indigo);font-size:1rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:.2s;}
.tp-btn:hover{background:var(--indigo);color:#f3ead8;border-color:var(--indigo);}
.tp-btn.play{background:var(--shu);color:#f3ead8;border-color:var(--shu);}
.tp-slider{width:100%;-webkit-appearance:none;height:4px;background:var(--line);outline:none;margin:1rem 0 .4rem;}
.tp-slider::-webkit-slider-thumb{-webkit-appearance:none;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--shu);cursor:pointer;border:2px solid #fffef9;}
.tp-slider::-moz-range-thumb{width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--shu);
  cursor:pointer;border:2px solid #fffef9;}
.tp-legend{display:flex;gap:1.4rem;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.8rem;color:#4a463d;}
.tp-legend span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;}
.tp-legend .dot{width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;border:2px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--line);}
.map-frame{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:8px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 1px 0 var(--line);}
.map-frame::after{content:'';display:block;height:6px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-top:none;margin-top:8px;}
.japan-map{width:100%;height:clamp(340px,60vh,600px);}
.map-legends{margin-top:.8rem;}
.map-legends .tp-legend{margin-bottom:.4rem;}
.person-icon{width:28px;height:28px;box-sizing:border-box;border-radius:50%!important;overflow:hidden;color:#fff;font-family:'Noto Serif JP',serif;font-weight:700;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:.85rem;border:2px solid #fff;
  box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.4);cursor:pointer;}
.event-icon{width:16px;height:16px;box-sizing:border-box;border-radius:50%!important;background:var(--gold);cursor:pointer;border:2px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.4);}
.han-pin{position:relative;width:0;height:0;pointer-events:none;}
.han-pin .dot{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);box-sizing:border-box;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.4);}
.han-pin .label{z-index:5;position:absolute;left:0;bottom:6px;transform:translateX(-50%);font-family:'Noto Serif JP',serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.15;color:#111;
  background:none;border:none;padding:0;white-space:nowrap;text-shadow:-1.5px -1.5px 0 #fff,1.5px -1.5px 0 #fff,-1.5px 1.5px 0 #fff,1.5px 1.5px 0 #fff,0 -2px 0 #fff,0 2px 0 #fff,-2px 0 0 #fff,2px 0 0 #fff,0 0 4px #fff;}
.kuni-label{pointer-events:none;font-family:'Noto Serif JP',serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;color:#111;
  background:none;padding:0;white-space:nowrap;text-shadow:-1.5px -1.5px 0 #fff,1.5px -1.5px 0 #fff,-1.5px 1.5px 0 #fff,1.5px 1.5px 0 #fff,0 -2px 0 #fff,0 2px 0 #fff,-2px 0 0 #fff,2px 0 0 #fff,0 0 4px #fff;transition:opacity .2s;}

.event-popup .maplibregl-popup-content{padding:5px 9px;min-width:0;width:max-content;max-width:18em;font-family:'Noto Serif JP',serif;font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;color:var(--indigo);border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.18);}
.event-popup .maplibregl-popup-tip{border-top-color:#fffef9;}
.event-icon.boshin-event{background:#c0392b!important;z-index:1000!important;}
.boshin-legend{display:flex;gap:1.2rem;margin-top:.6rem;font-size:.8rem;color:#4a463d;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.boshin-legend span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;}
.boshin-legend i{width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;}
.hakodate-legend{display:flex;gap:1.2rem;margin-top:.6rem;font-size:.8rem;color:#4a463d;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.hakodate-legend span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;}
.hakodate-legend i{width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;}

.stance-legend{display:flex;gap:1.2rem;margin-top:.6rem;font-size:.8rem;color:#4a463d;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.stance-legend span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;}
.stance-legend i{width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;}
.map-extra-controls{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;margin-top:.7rem;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.82rem;color:#4a463d;}
.place-toggle{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;cursor:pointer;user-select:none;}
.han-note{font-size:.72rem;color:#6b6553;max-width:520px;line-height:1.5;}
.place-marker{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#5a3d1e;border:1.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,.25);cursor:pointer;position:relative;z-index:6;}
.place-marker.event{background:var(--shu);}
.place-marker.han{background:#2d5fa3;}
.kuni-label{z-index:1;}
.maplibregl-marker:has(.place-marker){z-index:6;}
.maplibregl-marker:has(.kuni-label){z-index:1;}
.shishi-section{background:var(--washi-deep);}
.shishi-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:1px;background:var(--line);
  border:1px solid var(--line);}
.shishi-card{background:var(--washi-deep);position:relative;}
.shishi-panel{height:180px;background:var(--indigo);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;}
.shishi-panel span{font-family:'Noto Serif JP',serif;font-size:2.4rem;color:rgba(243,234,216,.9);font-weight:700;
  writing-mode:vertical-rl;letter-spacing:.15em;}
.shishi-info{padding:1.5rem;}
.shishi-info h3{font-size:1.3rem;color:var(--indigo);margin-bottom:.25rem;}
.shishi-meta{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--shu);margin-bottom:.9rem;letter-spacing:.02em;}
.shishi-info p{font-size:.9rem;color:#4a463d;margin-bottom:1.2rem;min-height:3.4em;}
.detail-btn{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;width:100%;padding:.7rem 0;
  border-top:1px solid var(--line);background:none;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Noto Serif JP',serif;
  font-weight:700;color:var(--indigo);font-size:.9rem;}
.detail-btn .seal{width:26px;height:26px;font-size:.7rem;}
.footer{background:var(--indigo-deep);color:#9aa4b6;padding:3rem 0 1.5rem;margin-top:2rem;
  padding-bottom:calc(1.5rem + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px));}
.footer-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2rem;padding-bottom:2rem;
  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);}
.footer-top h4{color:#f3ead8;font-size:1.05rem;margin-bottom:.5rem;}
.footer-top p{font-size:.85rem;max-width:26em;}
.footer-bottom{text-align:center;padding-top:1.5rem;font-size:.78rem;}
.modal{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:2000;background:rgba(14,22,38,.75);overflow-y:auto;}
.modal-content{background:var(--washi);margin:6% auto;padding:2.4rem;max-width:640px;position:relative;
  border-top:3px solid var(--shu);}
.close{position:absolute;right:1.3rem;top:1.1rem;font-size:1.6rem;cursor:pointer;color:#9c917a;}
.close:hover{color:var(--shu);}
.modal-content h2{color:var(--indigo);font-size:1.6rem;margin-bottom:1.6rem;}
.timeline{border-left:2px solid var(--gold);padding-left:1.8rem;margin-left:.4rem;}
.timeline-item{margin-bottom:1.3rem;position:relative;}
.timeline-item::before{content:'';position:absolute;left:-2.32rem;top:5px;width:10px;height:10px;
  background:var(--shu);border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--washi);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--gold);}
.timeline-year{font-weight:700;color:var(--indigo);font-family:'Noto Serif JP',serif;}
.kuni-popup{font-family:'Noto Sans JP',sans-serif;font-size:.85rem;}
.kuni-popup b{font-family:'Noto Serif JP',serif;color:var(--indigo);}
@media (max-width:768px){
  .nav{display:none;}
  .hero h2{font-size:1.9rem;}
  .section-head .tab{display:none;}
  .japan-map{height:380px;}
  .tp-top{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="header">
  <div class="container header-content">
    <div class="logo">
      <span class="seal">幕</span>
      <div class="logo-text"><h1>幕末維新MAP</h1><p>志士たちの足跡を辿る</p></div>
    </div>
    <nav class="nav"><ul>
      <li><a href="#map">地図で探す</a></li>
      <li><a href="#shishi">志士一覧</a></li>
      <li><a href="#about">このサイトについて</a></li>
    </ul></nav>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow"><span class="rule"></span>嘉永六年 - 明治十年</div>
    <h2>時代を駆け抜けた<br>志士たちの物語</h2>
    <p>黒船来航から西南戦争まで。年表スライダーを動かすと、三人の志士が地図の上をその足跡どおりに移動する。旧国の境界と地名も重ねて表示。</p>
    <a href="#map" class="cta">地図をひらく</a>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-waves">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1200 160" preserveAspectRatio="none" style="width:100%;height:120px;">
      <path d="M0,120 C150,90 300,140 450,110 C600,80 750,130 900,100 C1050,75 1150,110 1200,95 L1200,160 L0,160 Z" fill="#e9dcbf"/>
      <path d="M0,140 C180,120 360,150 540,130 C720,112 900,145 1080,125 C1140,118 1170,130 1200,124 L1200,160 L0,160 Z" fill="#f3ead8"/>
    </svg>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="map" class="map-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><span class="tab">地図</span>
      <div><h2>インタラクティブ年表地図</h2><p>スライダーで時代を進めると人物マーカーが移動します。灰色の線は旧国境界、文字は旧国名です</p></div>
    </div>

    <div class="timeline-panel">
      <div class="tp-top">
        <div>
          <span class="tp-year" id="tpYear">1853</span>
          <span class="tp-title" id="tpTitle">黒船来航</span>
          <div class="tp-desc" id="tpDesc"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tp-controls">
          <button class="tp-btn" id="btnPrev" title="前へ">&#8592;</button>
          <button class="tp-btn play" id="btnPlay" title="自動再生">&#9654;</button>
          <button class="tp-btn" id="btnNext" title="次へ">&#8594;</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <input type="range" class="tp-slider" id="tpSlider" min="0" max="11" value="0" step="1">
    </div>

    <div class="map-frame"><div id="japanMap" class="japan-map"></div></div>
    <div class="map-legends">
      <div class="tp-legend">
        <span><i class="dot" style="background:#2d5fa3"></i>坂本龍馬</span>
        <span><i class="dot" style="background:#a5372a"></i>西郷隆盛</span>
        <span><i class="dot" style="background:#2f7d4f"></i>高杉晋作</span>
        <span><i class="dot" style="background:var(--gold)"></i>主な出来事</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stance-legend">
        <span><i style="background:#b23b3b"></i>御三家</span>
        <span><i style="background:#c98cc0"></i>親藩</span>
        <span><i style="background:#e0952e"></i>譜代</span>
        <span><i style="background:#4f8f52"></i>外様</span>
        <span><i style="background:#5d7396"></i>幕領</span>
        <span><i style="background:#9fb1cc"></i>旗本領</span>
        <span><i style="background:#7d8fb3"></i>三卿領</span>
        <span><i style="background:#cfc6ad"></i>社寺・公家領など</span>
      </div>
      <div class="boshin-legend" style="display:none">
        <span><i style="background:#c0392b"></i>薩摩・長州・土佐・肥前</span>
        <span><i style="background:#5d8f58"></i>会津</span>
        <span><i style="background:#a9c7a0"></i>奥羽越列藩同盟</span>
        <span><i style="background:#e9968c"></i>その他</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hakodate-legend" style="display:none">
        <span><i style="background:#4a5fa8"></i>蝦夷共和国(渡島半島)</span>
        <span><i style="background:#e9968c"></i>明治政府側</span>
      </div>
      <div class="map-extra-controls">
        <span class="han-note">藩領は幕末期近世村領域データセットの村点(領分)から作成した概略です。藩名はズームすると順に表示されます。北海道・沖縄はデータがありません。</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="shishi" class="shishi-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="divider"><span class="seal">誌</span></div>
    <div class="section-head"><span class="tab">列伝</span>
      <div><h2>注目の志士たち</h2><p>時代を動かした人々の足跡</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="shishi-grid">
      <div class="shishi-card">
        <div class="shishi-panel"><span>坂本龍馬</span></div>
        <div class="shishi-info">
          <h3>坂本龍馬</h3>
          <p class="shishi-meta">土佐藩 | 1836 - 1867</p>
          <p>薩長同盟の立役者。海援隊を率い、近代日本の礎を築いた志士。</p>
          <button class="detail-btn" onclick="showProfile('ryoma')">詳細を見る <span class="seal">見</span></button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="shishi-card">
        <div class="shishi-panel"><span>西郷隆盛</span></div>
        <div class="shishi-info">
          <h3>西郷隆盛</h3>
          <p class="shishi-meta">薩摩藩 | 1828 - 1877</p>
          <p>維新三傑の一人。江戸無血開城を実現し、明治政府を支えた。</p>
          <button class="detail-btn" onclick="showProfile('saigo')">詳細を見る <span class="seal">見</span></button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="shishi-card">
        <div class="shishi-panel"><span>高杉晋作</span></div>
        <div class="shishi-info">
          <h3>高杉晋作</h3>
          <p class="shishi-meta">長州藩 | 1839 - 1867</p>
          <p>奇兵隊を創設。「おもしろきこともなき世をおもしろく」の辞世で知られる。</p>
          <button class="detail-btn" onclick="showProfile('takasugi')">詳細を見る <span class="seal">見</span></button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="footer" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-top">
      <div><h4>幕末維新MAP</h4><p>幕末維新の歴史を地図とともに探索する、非公式の学習・鑑賞用サイトです。地図タイル: 国土地理院タイル (MapLibre GL JS)。旧国境界データ: 国土数値情報。</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-bottom">&copy; 2026 幕末維新MAP</div>
  </div>
</footer>

<div id="profileModal" class="modal">
  <div class="modal-content">
    <span class="close">&times;</span>
    <div id="profileContent"></div>
  </div>
</div>

